stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW
    NEW --> NEEDS_CLARIFICATION: essential missing input
    NEW --> PLANNING: admitted goal
    NEEDS_CLARIFICATION --> PLANNING: authenticated revision answer
    NEEDS_CLARIFICATION --> BLOCKED: missing/expired answer
    PLANNING --> READY: feasible plan and policy
    PLANNING --> BLOCKED: unavailable capability or data
    READY --> RUNNING: dispatch authorized tasks
    RUNNING --> WAITING_APPROVAL: consequential action proposed
    WAITING_APPROVAL --> RUNNING: exact fresh approval
    WAITING_APPROVAL --> BLOCKED: denied/expired/changed
    RUNNING --> VERIFYING: persisted outputs
    VERIFYING --> VERIFIED: all required independent checks pass
    VERIFYING --> REPAIRING: failed check and budget available
    REPAIRING --> VERIFYING: repaired artifact version and recheck
    VERIFYING --> PARTIAL: unresolved optional requirement
    VERIFYING --> FAILED: required checks fail, retries exhausted
    RUNNING --> FAILED: tool failure, no safe recovery
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: authenticated cancel accepted
    READY --> CANCELLED
    PARTIAL --> [*]
    BLOCKED --> [*]
    VERIFIED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
